<title>USA: Tropical storm to become typhoon off Philippines.</title>
<headline>Tropical storm to become typhoon off Philippines.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, MASS. 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tropical Storm Opal, with 50 mph winds, is in the eastern Philippine Sea near 15.7n/132.4e, nearly stationary, private weather forecaster Weather Services Corp said.</p>
<p>The storm will intensify to a typhoon with 98 mph winds within 48 hours. It will begin a slow north northwest movement, threatening shipping.</p>
